AlwaysEnglish (Rust + Slint edition)

This project is a rewrite of AlwaysEnglish by ChaXxl
  https://github.com/ChaXxl/AlwaysEnglish
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Material taken over from the original project:
  - the application idea, feature set, UI layout and interaction flow
  - the Simplified Chinese translations (adapted into lang/zh_CN/.../always-english.po)
  - the icons in assets/: favicon.ico (and the icon.png converted from it),
    start.png, stop.png, logo.png

Changes made in this edition:
  - the whole application was re-implemented in Rust, with a Slint user
    interface instead of Qt/QML + FluentUI for QML;
  - new: single-instance support, resuming the last mode on launch, a
    configurable close-button behaviour, tray menu mode switching, settings
    migration from the Qt version, and several bug fixes (see README.md).

The original project's UI was built on FluentUI for QML by zhuzichu520
  https://github.com/zhuzichu520/FluentUI

The user interface is built with Slint (https://slint.dev), used under the
Slint Royalty-free Desktop, Mobile, and Web Applications License 2.0.
